kore wa jiken da</span></p><p begin="3.221" end="6.000" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="3.221" end="3.481">つ</span><span begin="3.481" end="3.661">ま</span><span begin="3.661" end="3.831">ら</span><span begin="3.831" end="4.000">な</span><span begin="4.000" end="4.171">い</span><span begin="4.171" end="4.341">こ</span><span begin="4.341" end="4.521">と</span><span begin="4.521" end="4.681">ば</span><span begin="4.681" end="4.860">か</span><span begin="4.860" end="5.041">り</span><span begin="5.041" end="5.191">の</span><span begin="5.191" end="5.380">今</span><span begin="5.380" end="5.561">日</span><span begin="5.561" end="5.661">に</span><span begin="5.661" end="6.000">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在满是无聊琐事的今天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsumaranai koto bakari no kyō ni sa</span></p><p begin="6.001" end="8.780" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="6.001" end="6.261">そ</span><span begin="6.261" end="6.420">れ</span><span begin="6.420" end="6.591">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">突</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.591" end="6.891">とつ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">然</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.891" end="7.471">ぜん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">現</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.471" end="7.991">あらわ</span></span></span><span begin="7.991" end="8.161">れ</span><span begin="8.161" end="8.340">た</span><span begin="8.340" end="8.511">ん</span><span begin="8.511" end="8.780">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">它就这样突然出现在眼前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore wa totsuzen arawaretanda</span></p><p begin="8.851" end="11.560" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.851" end="9.201">だれ</span></span></span><span begin="9.201" end="9.381">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.381" end="9.531">わ</span></span></span><span begin="9.531" end="9.720">か</span><span begin="9.720" end="9.901">ら</span><span begin="9.901" end="10.040">な</span><span begin="10.040" end="10.200">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.200" end="10.591">あん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">号</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.591" end="10.941">ごう</span></span></span><span begin="10.941" end="11.101">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.101" end="11.291">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.291" end="11.560">み</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无人知晓的暗号含义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare mo wakaranai angō no imi</span></p><p begin="11.551" end="14.380" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.551" end="11.881">さが</span></span></span><span begin="11.881" end="12.141">し</span><span begin="12.141" end="12.340">て</span><span begin="12.340" end="12.491">い</span><span begin="12.491" end="12.671">る</span><span begin="12.671" end="12.951">の</span> <span begin="12.951" end="13.270">ずっ</span><span begin="13.270" end="13.441">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.441" end="13.791">さが</span></span></span><span begin="13.791" end="14.051">し</span><span begin="14.051" end="14.230">て</span><span begin="14.230" end="14.380">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我正寻找着 一直在寻找着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sagashite iru no zutto sagashiteru</span></p><p begin="14.401" end="17.080" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="14.401" end="14.571">な</span><span begin="14.571" end="14.731">に</span><span begin="14.731" end="14.920">か</span><span begin="14.920" end="15.100">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">求</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.100" end="15.441">もと</span></span></span><span begin="15.441" end="15.611">め</span><span begin="15.611" end="15.750">て</span><span begin="15.750" end="15.900">は</span><span begin="15.900" end="16.140">す</span><span begin="16.140" end="16.311">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.311" end="16.471">ぬ</span></span></span><span begin="16.471" end="16.651">け</span><span begin="16.651" end="16.831">て</span><span begin="16.831" end="17.080">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">每当追寻着什么 却又从指间溜走</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nanika o motomete wa surinuketeku</span></p><p begin="17.171" end="19.940" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="17.171" end="17.331">だ</span><span begin="17.331" end="17.531">か</span><span begin="17.531" end="17.701">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">逃</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="17.701" end="17.961">のが</span></span></span><span begin="17.961" end="18.221">せ</span><span begin="18.221" end="18.360">な</span><span begin="18.360" end="18.561">い</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.561" end="18.911">こん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">回</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.911" end="19.220">かい</span></span></span><span begin="19.220" end="19.341">こ</span><span begin="19.341" end="19.580">そ</span><span begin="19.580" end="19.940">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所以这一次 绝不能再错过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dakara nogasenai konkai koso wa</span></p><p begin="19.951" end="22.680" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">迷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.951" end="20.300">まよ</span></span></span><span begin="20.300" end="20.471">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">毎</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.471" end="20.931">まい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.931" end="21.160">にち</span></span></span><span begin="21.160" end="21.341">に</span><span begin="21.341" end="21.460">た</span><span begin="21.460" end="21.591">だ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">終</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.591" end="21.931">しゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">止</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.931" end="22.211">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">符</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.211" end="22.360">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="22.360" end="22.680">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只为迷惘的每一天画上休止符</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mayou mainichi ni tada shūshifu o</span></p><p begin="23.151" end="26.801" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.151" end="23.591">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.591" end="23.771">ご</span></span></span><span begin="23.771" end="23.940">に</span><span begin="23.940" end="24.281">は</span><span begin="24.281" end="24.420">こ</span><span begin="24.420" end="24.571">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.571" end="24.921">じん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.921" end="25.331">せい</span></span></span><span begin="25.331" end="25.491">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.491" end="25.860">こた</span></span></span><span begin="25.860" end="25.951">え</span><span begin="25.951" end="26.190">さ</span><span begin="26.190" end="26.340">え</span><span begin="26.340" end="26.451">も</span><span begin="26.451" end="26.801">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">到了最后 就连这一生的答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saigo ni wa kono jinsei no kotae sae mo sa</span></p><p begin="26.801" end="28.216" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.801" end="27.241">すい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.241" end="27.401">り</span></span></span><span begin="27.401" end="27.541">で</span><span begin="27.541" end="27.751">き</span><span begin="27.751" end="27.931">る</span><span begin="27.931" end="28.216">の?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也能推理出来吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suiri dekiru no?</span></p><p begin="28.791" end="30.961" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.791" end="28.931">い</span></span></span><span begin="28.931" end="29.131">き</span><span begin="29.131" end="29.321">て</span><span begin="29.321" end="29.471">ゆ</span><span begin="29.471" end="29.700">く</span> <span begin="29.831" end="30.011">こ</span><span begin="30.011" end="30.180">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">毎</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.180" end="30.631">まい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.631" end="30.871">にち</span></span></span><span begin="30.871" end="30.961">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在不断走下去的每一天里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ikite yuku kono mainichi ni</span></p><p begin="30.961" end="33.720" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">少</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.961" end="31.291">すこ</span></span></span><span begin="31.291" end="31.571">し</span><span begin="31.571" end="31.740">ば</span><span begin="31.740" end="31.920">か</span><span begin="31.920" end="32.080">り</span><span begin="32.080" end="32.171">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">証</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.171" end="32.601">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">拠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.601" end="32.780">こ</span></span></span><span begin="32.780" end="32.961">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.961" end="33.081">み</span></span></span><span begin="33.081" end="33.301">つ</span><span begin="33.301" end="33.481">け</span><span begin="33.481" end="33.720">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">找到些许微小的证据</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sukoshi bakari no shōko o mitsukete</span></p><p begin="33.881" end="35.940" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.881" end="34.241">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">新</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.241" end="34.681">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">話</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.681" end="34.861">わ</span></span></span><span begin="34.861" end="35.041">が</span><span begin="35.041" end="35.220">プ</span><span begin="35.220" end="35.351">ロ</span><span begin="35.351" end="35.731">ロー</span><span begin="35.731" end="35.940">グ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最新一话便是序章</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saishinwa ga purorōgu</span></p><p begin="36.071" end="38.060" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="36.071" end="36.311">わ</span><span begin="36.311" end="36.420">た</span><span begin="36.420" end="36.601">し</span><span begin="36.601" end="36.711">た</span><span begin="36.711" end="36.951">ち</span><span begin="36.951" end="37.121">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">書</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.121" end="37.271">か</span></span></span><span begin="37.271" end="37.471">き</span><span begin="37.471" end="37.631">か</span><span begin="37.631" end="37.821">け</span><span begin="37.821" end="38.060">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">属于我们尚未写完的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashitachi no kakikake no</span></p><p begin="38.161" end="39.420" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="38.161" end="38.341">こ</span><span begin="38.341" end="38.501">の</span><span begin="38.501" end="38.691">ミ</span><span begin="38.691" end="38.851">ス</span><span begin="38.851" end="39.020">テ</span><span begin="39.020" end="39.420">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这篇推理故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono misuterī</span></p><p begin="39.431" end="42.880" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">新</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.431" end="39.891">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">米</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.891" end="40.241">まい</span></span></span><span begin="40.241" end="40.411">だ</span><span begin="40.411" end="40.591">け</span><span begin="40.591" end="40.931">ど</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">必</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.931" end="41.191">ひっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">死</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.191" end="41.360">し</span></span></span><span begin="41.360" end="41.461">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.461" end="41.801">い</span></span></span><span begin="41.801" end="41.971">き</span><span begin="41.971" end="42.160">て</span><span begin="42.160" end="42.281">い</span><span begin="42.281" end="42.491">る</span><span begin="42.491" end="42.671">か</span><span begin="42.671" end="42.880">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽然还是新手 却也在拼命活着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinmai dakedo hisshi ni ikite iru kara</span></p><p begin="42.931" end="44.980" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.931" end="43.300">すい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.300" end="43.471">り</span></span></span><span begin="43.471" end="43.621">さ</span><span begin="43.621" end="43.830">せ</span><span begin="43.830" end="43.971">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.971" end="44.401">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="44.401" end="44.581">ご</span></span></span><span begin="44.581" end="44.751">ま</span><span begin="44.751" end="44.980">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就让我推理到最后吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suiri sasete saigo made</span></p><p begin="45.060" end="48.440" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="45.060" end="45.201">い</span><span begin="45.201" end="45.441">つ</span><span begin="45.441" end="45.620">か</span><span begin="45.620" end="45.961">あ</span><span begin="45.961" end="46.190">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="46.190" end="46.481">ほし</span></span></span><span begin="46.481" end="46.601">た</span><span begin="46.601" end="46.831">ち</span><span begin="46.831" end="47.171">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">煌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="47.171" end="47.521">きら</span></span></span><span begin="47.521" end="47.680">め</span><span begin="47.680" end="47.871">い</span><span begin="47.871" end="48.041">た</span><span begin="48.041" end="48.221">ま</span><span begin="48.221" end="48.440">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">终有一天 那些星辰依然璀璨闪烁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka ano hoshitachi ga kirameita mama</span></p><p begin="48.470" end="50.500" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="48.470" end="48.741">そ</span><span begin="48.741" end="48.911">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.911" end="49.261">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.261" end="49.420">ば</span></span></span><span begin="49.420" end="49.601">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">照</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.601" end="49.750">て</span></span></span><span begin="49.750" end="49.871">ら</span><span begin="49.871" end="50.121">す</span><span begin="50.121" end="50.301">か</span><span begin="50.301" end="50.500">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将那些话语照亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono kotoba o terasu kara</span></p><p begin="50.641" end="53.980" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="50.641" end="50.991">きっ</span><span begin="50.991" end="51.171">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.171" end="51.681">せい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">解</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.681" end="52.031">かい</span></span></span><span begin="52.031" end="52.201">だ</span><span begin="52.201" end="52.380">け</span><span begin="52.380" end="52.611">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="52.611" end="53.031">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.031" end="53.421">じつ</span></span></span><span begin="53.421" end="53.591">だ</span><span begin="53.591" end="53.780">け</span><span begin="53.780" end="53.980">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一定唯有正解 唯有真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto seikai dake wa shinjitsu dake wa</span></p><p begin="54.111" end="56.780" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.111" end="54.460">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="54.460" end="54.811">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.811" end="54.951">だ</span></span></span><span begin="54.951" end="55.051">き</span><span begin="55.051" end="55.331">し</span><span begin="55.331" end="55.501">め</span><span begin="55.501" end="55.681">て</span><span begin="55.681" end="55.861">く</span><span begin="55.861" end="56.020">れ</span><span begin="56.020" end="56.191">る</span><span begin="56.191" end="56.371">か</span><span begin="56.371" end="56.541">ら</span><span begin="56.541" end="56.780">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">定会将你拥入怀中啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi o dakishimete kureru kara ne</span></p><p begin="1:07.031" end="1:09.821" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:07.031" end="1:07.191">そ</span><span begin="1:07.191" end="1:07.471">し</span><span begin="1:07.471" end="1:07.640">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.640" end="1:07.991">いま</span></span></span><span begin="1:07.991" end="1:08.081">も</span><span begin="1:08.081" end="1:08.511">さ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">謎</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.511" end="1:08.840">なぞ</span></span></span><span begin="1:08.840" end="1:09.031">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">深</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.031" end="1:09.371">ふか</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.371" end="1:09.560">ま</span><span begin="1:09.560" end="1:09.821">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">而直到现在 谜团依然在加深</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soshite ima mo sa nazo wa fukamaru</span></p><p begin="1:09.821" end="1:12.580" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.821" end="1:10.240">つか</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.240" end="1:10.411">み</span><span begin="1:10.411" end="1:10.591">ど</span><span begin="1:10.591" end="1:10.760">こ</span><span begin="1:10.760" end="1:10.931">ろ</span><span begin="1:10.931" end="1:11.111">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.111" end="1:11.340">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.340" end="1:11.451">い</span><span begin="1:11.451" end="1:11.641">か</span><span begin="1:11.641" end="1:11.800">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">慌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.800" end="1:12.151">あわ</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.151" end="1:12.321">て</span><span begin="1:12.321" end="1:12.580">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为毫无头绪而慌了手脚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsukamidokoro mo nai kara awatete</span></p><p begin="1:12.671" end="1:15.341" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">考</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.671" end="1:13.180">かんが</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.180" end="1:13.361">え</span><span begin="1:13.361" end="1:13.531">て</span><span begin="1:13.531" end="1:13.711">て</span><span begin="1:13.711" end="1:14.051">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">迷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.051" end="1:14.400">まよ</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.400" end="1:14.581">う</span><span begin="1:14.581" end="1:14.741">ば</span><span begin="1:14.741" end="1:14.920">か</span><span begin="1:14.920" end="1:15.101">り</span><span begin="1:15.101" end="1:15.341">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">即便苦苦思索 也只是徒增迷惘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kangaetete mo mayou bakari no</span></p><p begin="1:15.341" end="1:18.160" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:15.341" end="1:15.621">そ</span><span begin="1:15.621" end="1:15.800">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.800" end="1:16.141">あん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">号</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.141" end="1:16.481">ごう</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.481" end="1:16.661">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.661" end="1:16.970">こた</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.970" end="1:17.181">え</span><span begin="1:17.181" end="1:17.340">は</span><span begin="1:17.340" end="1:17.531">ユ</span><span begin="1:17.531" end="1:17.680">ラ</span><span begin="1:17.680" end="1:17.881">ユ</span><span begin="1:17.881" end="1:18.160">ラ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那道暗号的答案摇曳不定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono angō no kotae wa yurayura</span></p><p begin="1:18.701" end="1:19.680" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:18.701" end="1:18.860">今</span><span begin="1:18.860" end="1:19.071">日</span><span begin="1:19.071" end="1:19.261">く</span><span begin="1:19.261" end="1:19.440">ら</span><span begin="1:19.440" end="1:19.680">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">至少在今天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyō kurai</span></p><p begin="1:19.781" end="1:22.301" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:19.781" end="1:19.940">こ</span><span begin="1:19.940" end="1:20.041">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">寂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.041" end="1:20.381">さび</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.381" end="1:20.651">し</span><span begin="1:20.651" end="1:20.821">さ</span><span begin="1:20.821" end="1:20.951">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.951" end="1:21.160">り</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">由</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:21.160" end="1:21.451">ゆう</span></span></span><span begin="1:21.451" end="1:21.650">ひ</span><span begin="1:21.650" end="1:21.791">と</span><span begin="1:21.791" end="1:22.060">つ</span><span begin="1:22.060" end="1:22.301">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这份寂寞的一个理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono sabishisa no riyū hitotsu o</span></p><p begin="1:22.301" end="1:23.660" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:22.301" end="1:22.650">すい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:22.650" end="1:22.801">り</span></span></span><span begin="1:22.801" end="1:23.071">し</span><span begin="1:23.071" end="1:23.241">た</span><span begin="1:23.241" end="1:23.421">く</span><span begin="1:23.421" end="1:23.660">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">好想将它推理出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suiri shitakute</span></p><p begin="1:24.281" end="1:27.060" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.281" end="1:24.391">み</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.391" end="1:24.621">つ</span><span begin="1:24.621" end="1:24.811">か</span><span begin="1:24.811" end="1:24.981">ら</span><span begin="1:24.981" end="1:25.160">な</span><span begin="1:25.160" end="1:25.271">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">証</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.271" end="1:25.671">しょう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">拠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.671" end="1:26.021">こ</span></span></span> <span begin="1:26.021" end="1:26.191">ふ</span><span begin="1:26.191" end="1:26.311">た</span><span begin="1:26.311" end="1:26.540">つ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">持っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.540" end="1:26.891">もっ</span></span></span><span begin="1:26.891" end="1:27.060">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">怀揣着两份无处寻觅的证据</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mitsukaranai shōko futatsu motte</span></p><p begin="1:27.080" end="1:29.380" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:27.080" end="1:27.260">明</span><span begin="1:27.260" end="1:27.591">日</span><span begin="1:27.591" end="1:27.751">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">扉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.751" end="1:28.281">とびら</span></span></span><span begin="1:28.281" end="1:28.451">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">向</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.451" end="1:28.621">む</span></span></span><span begin="1:28.621" end="1:28.780">こ</span><span begin="1:28.780" end="1:28.971">う</span><span begin="1:28.971" end="1:29.071">で</span><span begin="1:29.071" end="1:29.380">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在通往明日的门扉彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ashita no tobira no mukō de sa</span></p><p begin="1:29.391" end="1:32.880" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:29.391" end="1:29.731">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">終</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:29.731" end="1:30.191">しゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">的</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.191" end="1:30.521">てき</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">完</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.521" end="1:30.841">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:30.841" end="1:31.231">ぜん</span></span></span><span begin="1:31.231" end="1:31.571">な</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">論</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.571" end="1:31.921">ろん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.921" end="1:32.091">り</span></span></span><span begin="1:32.091" end="1:32.261">の</span><span begin="1:32.261" end="1:32.441">彼</span><span begin="1:32.441" end="1:32.880">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在终极完美逻辑的彼方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saishūteki kanzen na ronri no kanata</span></p><p begin="1:32.941" end="1:34.920" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:32.941" end="1:33.131">ひ</span><span begin="1:33.131" end="1:33.241">と</span><span begin="1:33.241" end="1:33.481">つ</span><span begin="1:33.481" end="1:33.651">ま</span><span begin="1:33.651" end="1:33.831">み</span><span begin="1:33.831" end="1:34.001">の</span><span begin="1:34.001" end="1:34.191">ミ</span><span begin="1:34.191" end="1:34.341">ス</span><span begin="1:34.341" end="1:34.491">テ</span><span begin="1:34.491" end="1:34.920">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一撮未解之谜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitotsumami no misuterī</span></p><p begin="1:35.041" end="1:37.020" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.041" end="1:35.391">なに</span></span></span><span begin="1:35.391" end="1:35.731">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.731" end="1:35.901">わ</span></span></span><span begin="1:35.901" end="1:36.221">かっ</span><span begin="1:36.221" end="1:36.440">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:36.440" end="1:36.601">い</span><span begin="1:36.601" end="1:36.780">な</span><span begin="1:36.780" end="1:37.020">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明明什么都还不明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani mo wakaccha inai</span></p><p begin="1:37.080" end="1:38.421" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:37.080" end="1:37.301">あ</span><span begin="1:37.301" end="1:37.471">り</span><span begin="1:37.471" end="1:37.641">の</span><span begin="1:37.641" end="1:37.811">ま</span><span begin="1:37.811" end="1:37.991">ま</span><span begin="1:37.991" end="1:38.091">の</span><span begin="1:38.091" end="1:38.421">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这份最真实的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">arinomama no sa</span></p><p begin="1:38.421" end="1:40.580" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.421" end="1:38.861">すい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.861" end="1:39.040">り</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.040" end="1:39.181">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.181" end="1:39.350">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.350" end="1:39.551">い</span><span begin="1:39.551" end="1:39.720">て</span><span begin="1:39.720" end="1:39.891">お</span><span begin="1:39.891" end="1:40.100">く</span><span begin="1:40.100" end="1:40.251">れ</span><span begin="1:40.251" end="1:40.580">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">推理也请你听一听吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suiri o kiite okure yo</span></p><p begin="1:40.591" end="1:41.201" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:40.591" end="1:40.780">ど</span><span begin="1:40.780" end="1:40.931">う</span><span begin="1:40.931" end="1:41.080">だ</span><span begin="1:41.080" end="1:41.201">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你说呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dō dai</span></p><p begin="1:41.201" end="1:43.980" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.201" end="1:41.631">そら</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.631" end="1:41.860">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">向</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.860" end="1:41.981">む</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.981" end="1:42.141">こ</span><span begin="1:42.141" end="1:42.321">う</span><span begin="1:42.321" end="1:42.671">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:42.671" end="1:43.040">こた</span></span></span><span begin="1:43.040" end="1:43.141">え</span><span begin="1:43.141" end="1:43.360">は</span><span begin="1:43.360" end="1:43.540">あ</span><span begin="1:43.540" end="1:43.711">る</span><span begin="1:43.711" end="1:43.980">の？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">天空的彼端会有答案吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sora no mukō ni kotae wa aru no?</span></p><p begin="1:44.020" end="1:46.020" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:44.020" end="1:44.241">あ</span><span begin="1:44.241" end="1:44.401">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.401" end="1:44.751">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:44.751" end="1:44.931">ば</span></span></span><span begin="1:44.931" end="1:45.101">の</span><span begin="1:45.101" end="1:45.271">欠</span><span begin="1:45.271" end="1:45.621">片</span><span begin="1:45.621" end="1:45.791">だ</span><span begin="1:45.791" end="1:46.020">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">唯有那些话语的碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ano kotoba no kakera dake</span></p><p begin="1:46.121" end="1:49.480" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="1:46.121" end="1:46.481">きっ</span><span begin="1:46.481" end="1:46.661">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.661" end="1:47.181">せい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">解</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.181" end="1:47.531">かい</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.531" end="1:47.701">だ</span><span begin="1:47.701" end="1:47.880">け</span><span begin="1:47.880" end="1:48.131">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.131" end="1:48.531">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.531" end="1:48.911">じつ</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.911" end="1:49.091">だ</span><span begin="1:49.091" end="1:49.280">け</span><span begin="1:49.280" end="1:49.480">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一定唯有正解 唯有真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto seikai dake wa shinjitsu dake wa</span></p><p begin="1:49.601" end="1:52.260" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.601" end="1:49.960">よる</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.960" end="1:50.301">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:50.301" end="1:50.460">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:50.460" end="1:50.551">き</span><span begin="1:50.551" end="1:50.821">し</span><span begin="1:50.821" end="1:50.991">め</span><span begin="1:50.991" end="1:51.171">て</span><span begin="1:51.171" end="1:51.340">く</span><span begin="1:51.340" end="1:51.520">れ</span><span begin="1:51.520" end="1:51.691">る</span><span begin="1:51.691" end="1:51.861">か</span><span begin="1:51.861" end="1:52.031">ら</span><span begin="1:52.031" end="1:52.260">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">定会将黑夜拥入怀中啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yoru o dakishimete kureru kara ne</span></p><p begin="2:02.681" end="2:04.720" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.681" end="2:03.021">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">新</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.021" end="2:03.471">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">話</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.471" end="2:03.651">わ</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.651" end="2:03.831">が</span><span begin="2:03.831" end="2:04.020">プ</span><span begin="2:04.020" end="2:04.131">ロ</span><span begin="2:04.131" end="2:04.511">ロー</span><span begin="2:04.511" end="2:04.720">グ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最新一话便是序章</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saishinwa ga purorōgu</span></p><p begin="2:04.861" end="2:06.820" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:04.861" end="2:05.041">わ</span><span begin="2:05.041" end="2:05.121">た</span><span begin="2:05.121" end="2:05.391">し</span><span begin="2:05.391" end="2:05.501">た</span><span begin="2:05.501" end="2:05.741">ち</span><span begin="2:05.741" end="2:05.901">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">書</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.901" end="2:06.061">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:06.061" end="2:06.251">き</span><span begin="2:06.251" end="2:06.431">か</span><span begin="2:06.431" end="2:06.611">け</span><span begin="2:06.611" end="2:06.820">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">属于我们尚未写完的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashitachi no kakikake no</span></p><p begin="2:06.941" end="2:08.200" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:06.941" end="2:07.121">こ</span><span begin="2:07.121" end="2:07.291">の</span><span begin="2:07.291" end="2:07.481">ミ</span><span begin="2:07.481" end="2:07.641">ス</span><span begin="2:07.641" end="2:07.820">テ</span><span begin="2:07.820" end="2:08.200">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这篇推理故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono misuterī</span></p><p begin="2:08.221" end="2:11.660" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">新</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.221" end="2:08.681">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">米</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.681" end="2:09.031">まい</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.031" end="2:09.201">だ</span><span begin="2:09.201" end="2:09.381">け</span><span begin="2:09.381" end="2:09.711">ど</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">必</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.711" end="2:09.981">ひっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">死</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.981" end="2:10.241">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.241" end="2:10.400">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">生</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.400" end="2:10.591">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.591" end="2:10.761">き</span><span begin="2:10.761" end="2:10.960">て</span><span begin="2:10.960" end="2:11.071">い</span><span begin="2:11.071" end="2:11.281">る</span><span begin="2:11.281" end="2:11.451">か</span><span begin="2:11.451" end="2:11.660">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽然还是新手 却也在拼命活着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinmai dakedo hisshi ni ikite iru kara</span></p><p begin="2:11.711" end="2:13.760" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.711" end="2:12.060">すい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.060" end="2:12.251">り</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.251" end="2:12.411">さ</span><span begin="2:12.411" end="2:12.600">せ</span><span begin="2:12.600" end="2:12.761">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.761" end="2:13.191">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.191" end="2:13.361">ご</span></span></span><span begin="2:13.361" end="2:13.541">ま</span><span begin="2:13.541" end="2:13.760">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就让我推理到最后吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suiri sasete saigo made</span></p><p begin="2:13.860" end="2:17.220" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:13.860" end="2:13.991">い</span><span begin="2:13.991" end="2:14.231">つ</span><span begin="2:14.231" end="2:14.400">か</span><span begin="2:14.400" end="2:14.751">あ</span><span begin="2:14.751" end="2:15.101">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.101" end="2:15.271">ほし</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.271" end="2:15.391">た</span><span begin="2:15.391" end="2:15.631">ち</span><span begin="2:15.631" end="2:15.961">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">煌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.961" end="2:16.300">きら</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.300" end="2:16.500">め</span><span begin="2:16.500" end="2:16.651">い</span><span begin="2:16.651" end="2:16.831">た</span><span begin="2:16.831" end="2:17.001">ま</span><span begin="2:17.001" end="2:17.220">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">终有一天 那些星辰依然璀璨闪烁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka ano hoshitachi ga kirameita mama</span></p><p begin="2:17.270" end="2:19.300" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:17.270" end="2:17.531">そ</span><span begin="2:17.531" end="2:17.701">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.701" end="2:18.051">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.051" end="2:18.220">ば</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.220" end="2:18.391">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">照</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.391" end="2:18.560">て</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.560" end="2:18.661">ら</span><span begin="2:18.661" end="2:18.901">す</span><span begin="2:18.901" end="2:19.091">か</span><span begin="2:19.091" end="2:19.300">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将那些话语照亮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono kotoba o terasu kara</span></p><p begin="2:19.431" end="2:22.780" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:19.431" end="2:19.781">きっ</span><span begin="2:19.781" end="2:20.031">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.031" end="2:20.471">せい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">解</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.471" end="2:20.821">かい</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.821" end="2:20.991">だ</span><span begin="2:20.991" end="2:21.180">け</span><span begin="2:21.180" end="2:21.411">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.411" end="2:21.821">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:21.821" end="2:22.211">じつ</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.211" end="2:22.371">だ</span><span begin="2:22.371" end="2:22.560">け</span><span begin="2:22.560" end="2:22.780">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一定唯有正解 唯有真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto seikai dake wa shinjitsu dake wa</span></p><p begin="2:22.890" end="2:25.300" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.890" end="2:23.260">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.260" end="2:23.591">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.591" end="2:23.741">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.741" end="2:23.841">き</span><span begin="2:23.841" end="2:24.121">し</span><span begin="2:24.121" end="2:24.291">め</span><span begin="2:24.291" end="2:24.461">て</span><span begin="2:24.461" end="2:24.640">く</span><span begin="2:24.640" end="2:24.820">れ</span><span begin="2:24.820" end="2:24.981">る</span><span begin="2:24.981" end="2:25.140">か</span><span begin="2:25.140" end="2:25.300">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">定会将你拥入怀中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi o dakishimete kureru kara</span></p><p begin="2:25.331" end="2:28.840" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">結</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.331" end="2:25.671">けっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">局</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.671" end="2:26.180">きょく</span></span></span> <span begin="2:26.180" end="2:26.371">あ</span><span begin="2:26.371" end="2:26.540">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.540" end="2:26.891">あん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">号</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.891" end="2:27.231">ごう</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.231" end="2:27.581">は</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.581" end="2:27.751">わ</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.751" end="2:27.931">か</span><span begin="2:27.931" end="2:28.101">ら</span><span begin="2:28.101" end="2:28.280">な</span><span begin="2:28.280" end="2:28.451">い</span><span begin="2:28.451" end="2:28.621">ま</span><span begin="2:28.621" end="2:28.840">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">到头来 那道暗号 依旧未能解开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kekkyoku ano angō wa wakaranai mama</span></p><p begin="2:28.971" end="2:30.240" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:28.971" end="2:29.321">大</span><span begin="2:29.321" end="2:29.491">人</span><span begin="2:29.491" end="2:29.661">に</span><span begin="2:29.661" end="2:29.840">な</span><span begin="2:29.840" end="2:30.011">る</span><span begin="2:30.011" end="2:30.240">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就这样长大成人了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">otona ni naru no</span></p><p begin="2:30.361" end="2:33.020" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">等</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.361" end="2:30.611">とう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">身</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.611" end="2:31.051">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.051" end="2:31.401">だい</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.401" end="2:31.741">の</span> <span begin="2:31.741" end="2:31.850">こ</span><span begin="2:31.850" end="2:32.001">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">推</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.001" end="2:32.420">すい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.420" end="2:32.611">り</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.611" end="2:32.731">た</span><span begin="2:32.731" end="2:33.020">ち</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这些最贴近自我的推理</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tōshindai no kono suiritachi</span></p><p begin="2:33.051" end="2:35.940" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:33.051" end="2:33.311">そ</span><span begin="2:33.311" end="2:33.481">の</span><span begin="2:33.481" end="2:33.831">ど</span><span begin="2:33.831" end="2:33.980">れ</span><span begin="2:33.980" end="2:34.171">も</span><span begin="2:34.171" end="2:34.511">が</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">証</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.511" end="2:35.040">あかし</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.040" end="2:35.221">に</span><span begin="2:35.221" end="2:35.561">なっ</span><span begin="2:35.561" end="2:35.940">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">每一个都化作了证明</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono dore mo ga akashi ni natta</span></p><p begin="2:36.020" end="2:39.421" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:36.020" end="2:36.191">い</span><span begin="2:36.191" end="2:36.431">つ</span><span begin="2:36.431" end="2:36.600">か</span><span begin="2:36.600" end="2:36.951">あ</span><span begin="2:36.951" end="2:37.120">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.120" end="2:37.461">ほし</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.461" end="2:37.591">た</span><span begin="2:37.591" end="2:37.821">ち</span><span begin="2:37.821" end="2:38.151">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">煌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.151" end="2:38.511">きら</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.511" end="2:38.680">め</span><span begin="2:38.680" end="2:38.851">い</span><span begin="2:38.851" end="2:39.031">た</span><span begin="2:39.031" end="2:39.201">ま</span><span begin="2:39.201" end="2:39.421">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">终有一天 那些星辰依然璀璨闪烁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsuka ano hoshitachi ga kirameita mama</span></p><p begin="2:39.421" end="2:41.551" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:39.421" end="2:39.721">そ</span><span begin="2:39.721" end="2:39.891">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.891" end="2:40.240">こた</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.240" end="2:40.400">え</span><span begin="2:40.400" end="2:40.591">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">照</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:40.591" end="2:40.760">て</span></span></span><span begin="2:40.760" end="2:40.851">ら</span><span begin="2:40.851" end="2:41.111">し</span><span begin="2:41.111" end="2:41.281">た</span><span begin="2:41.281" end="2:41.551">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">照亮了那个答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono kotae o terashita no</span></p><p begin="2:41.551" end="2:45.000" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span begin="2:41.551" end="2:41.711">そ</span><span begin="2:41.711" end="2:41.981">し</span><span begin="2:41.981" end="2:42.440">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.440" end="2:42.661">せい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">解</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.661" end="2:43.021">かい</span></span></span><span begin="2:43.021" end="2:43.191">だ</span><span begin="2:43.191" end="2:43.360">け</span><span begin="2:43.360" end="2:43.611">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.611" end="2:44.011">しん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">実</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.011" end="2:44.401">じつ</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.401" end="2:44.581">だ</span><span begin="2:44.581" end="2:44.760">け</span><span begin="2:44.760" end="2:45.000">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">而后唯有正解 唯有真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soshite seikai dake wa shinjitsu dake wa</span></p><p begin="2:45.091" end="2:48.046" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1_2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts